LC 451 — Sort Characters By Frequency
Pattern:Hashing

Logic:
Count each character.
Sort characters by frequency.
Build answer.

Algorithm:
Count characters
Sort by frequency
Add each character frequency times

CODE:
class Solution {
public:
    string frequencySort(string s) {
        unordered_map<char,int> mp;
        for (char c : s) mp[c]++;

        sort(s.begin(), s.end(), [&](char a, char b) {
            return mp[a] > mp[b];
        });

        return s;
    }
};

EX:
s = "tree"

t → 1
r → 1
e → 2

Answer = "eetr" ✅

Complexity:

Time: O(n log n)
Space: O(n)
